#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomObservabilityPerformancePlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Extend the canonical observability target with Framework-owned profiling,
#   metrics/traces, memory analysis, benchmarks, coverage, performance budgets
#   and toolkit-neutral operational dashboard state.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   Existing diagnostics/observability/runtime implementations remain
#   authoritative. This platform adds reusable performance engineering state
#   without creating a competing observability library in an application.
#
# AUTHOR AND ORGANISATION:
#   Sammy Hegab
#   Umicom Foundation
#
# LICENCE:
#   MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
